#:culture{:id "kgz.craft.kalpak", :name "Kalpak", :country "KGZ", :kind :craft, :summary "Turkic high-crowned cap, usually made of felt or sheepskin, worn throughout Central Asia and the Caucasus; Kyrgyz people wear white versions for special occasions.", :url "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalpak", :url-provenance :wikipedia-en, :retrieved-at "2026-07-17"}
